   374	I ⊂ [XB^{−C₀}, X] of length A ≥ XB^{−C₀}: #{n ∈ I : n ≡ r (q), P⁺(n) ≤ B} ≤ (A/q)ϱ(X)(log N)^{C_U(2C₀+2)+2}.
   375	*Proof.* [pp]; the only non-elementary step is Lemma U1(ii) with the shift B^{2C₀+1}. ∎
