   378	X′₊ := 2MV/Y, 𝒩_ℓ := {n ∈ 𝒮_B : MV/32 ≤ ℓ|n| ≤ 2MV}, and R₀ = B^{C₀} ≥ 64S²B/(ρ_rρ_F), uniformly for
   379	1 ≤ q ≤ 4S²:
   380	  E_{ℓ∈J}Σ_{n∈𝒩_ℓ} 𝔔(ℓ²|n|q)/φ(ℓ|n|) ≤ τ(q)(log N)^{C_L}·Ψ(X′₊)Ψ(X_F)²/(Yq(MV)²).
   381	*Proof and uniformity.* [pp]'s proof, line by line:
   382	- X_F, hence f(m′), is common to all ℓ (common V).
