  1754	\subsection{The residual square-class group}
  1755	Let $S_D$ be the set of primes of $\cO_K$ above primes dividing $D$. Put $V_D:=\{\gamma\in K^\times:\ord_\fP\gamma\text{ even for all }\fP\notin S_D\}$ and
