  1757	$\phi(\sS):=[\gamma_\sS]\in\sH$ is $\F_2$-linear in $\sS$, because $\gamma_{\sS+\sS'}=\gamma_\sS\gamma_{\sS'}/\gamma_{\sS\cap\sS'}^2$.
