  1765	$V_D\to\bigoplus_{\fP\in S_D}\Z/2$, $\gamma\mapsto(\ord_\fP\gamma\bmod2)$, has kernel $W_0$. The map $W_0\to\mathrm{Cl}(K)[2]$,
  1766	$\gamma\mapsto[\fa]$, is well defined (the ideal group is torsion-free) with kernel $Y_0$. And $Y_0/K^{\times2}\cong\cO_K^\times/\cO_K^{\times2}$ has order
