  1768	$d$ is fixed, so $\log|D|$ and $\log|\disc g|$ are $O_d(\log N)$. Every ideal class contains an integral ideal of norm at most
  1769	$\sqrt{|\Delta_K|}\le\sqrt{|\disc g|}$, and there are at most $X(1+\log X)^{d-1}$ integral ideals of norm at most $X$. So $\log h_K=O_d(\log N)$.
