  1772	\subsection{Characters}\label{sec:chars}
  1773	For $0\ne\fq\in\sH$ let $L_\fq:=K(\sqrt\fq)$, of degree $2d$. Put $\bar\Delta:=|\disc g|^2\,8^d|D|^d$.
