  1780	$\Delta_{L}=\Delta_K^2\Norm_{K/\Q}(\mathfrak d_{L/K})$. A representative $\gamma\in V_D$ has even valuation at every $\fP\nmid2D$, so $L/K$ is
  1781	unramified there. At $\fP\mid D$ with $\fP\nmid2$, $\ord_\fP\mathfrak d\le1$, and at $\fP\mid2$, $\ord_\fP\mathfrak d\le2\ord_\fP(2)+1$. So
  1782	$\Norm(\mathfrak d)\le8^d|D|^d$, and $|\Delta_K|\le|\disc g|$. For $F\subset L$, $|\Delta_F|^{[L:F]}$ divides $\Delta_L$, and $[L:F]=d$.
  1783	\end{proof}
