  1839	$t_\chi:=\lceil5d(\ln|\sH|_{\rm bd}+2\ln\log N)\rceil=O_d(\log N)$, where $|\sH|_{\rm bd}:=2^d|D|^dX_0(1+\log X_0)^{d-1}$ with $X_0:=\lceil\sqrt{|\disc g|}\,\rceil$ is a
  1840	computable upper bound for $|\sH|$ (proof of Lemma~\ref{lem:H}, using $2^{\omega(D)}\le|D|$), the probability that
  1841	$\sH_0:=\sH\cap\bigcap_j\ker\chi_{\fp_j}$ is not contained in $\mathsf E\cup\{0\}$ is at most $(\log N)^{-2}$. Otherwise $|\sH_0|\le2$.
