  1846	of $\fp$ is $\sigma$. The main term contributes $\frac12(\mathrm{Li}(x)-\mathrm{Li}(x/2))\ge x/(4\log x)(1-o(1))$ inert primes of norm in $(x/2,x]$. A real zero,
